## Completion Checklist

After writing tests:

1. **Run the tests**: `{{ stack.quality_gates.tests.command }} <spec_files>`
2. **Run system specs separately if slow**: `{{ stack.quality_gates.tests.command }} spec/system/`
3. **Ensure all pass**: Zero failures, zero pending
4. **Verify coverage**: {% if v.vc or v.phlex %}Component variants{% else %}Partial variants{% endif %}, edge cases (empty state, error state), and key interactions

Report test results including pass/fail counts.
